 "description": "Travel to another location. You give a destination, never coordinates \u2014 the world picks the route and how long it takes, and you arrive on your own. Check vacation_check_messages or look around again to see that you have arrived. look_around lists every destination with its travel options, when it is lively, and any entry price. Nothing is ever shut by the clock.",
